      "created_at": "2025-08-28T15:24:06.796Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I have created a custom field inside company named category of company , now i want that it should be only editable to role “Invoice Admin”, so how can i do it and secondly i also want that if a company category is b then certain fields should be hide , so i am thinking of using server script , so how can i do it?</p>",
