      "created_at": "2025-08-29T00:01:30.031Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Hi <a class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/burhanuddinnathdwara\">@BurhanuddinNathdwara</a></p>\n<p>Invoice Admin will be only one to work with category field if you can set <strong>prem level</strong> and define role permission manager for the same role as below;</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://docs.frappe.io/erpnext/user/manual/en/changing-the-properties-of-a-field-based-on-role\" class=\"onebox\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">https://docs.frappe.io/erpnext/user/manual/en/changing-the-properties-of-a-field-based-on-role</a></p>\n<p>Secondly if category field fills with certain type, some of the fields on the header of the same docytpe should not appear can also be configured by defining <strong>display depends upon</strong> condition within customization page as below;</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/4/6/46b9049e60d4c7bbe18170d9b3c8c6ba73fbeeac.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/46b9049e60d4c7bbe18170d9b3c8c6ba73fbeeac\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/4/6/46b9049e60d4c7bbe18170d9b3c8c6ba73fbeeac_2_690x393.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"a5DOYKZlrcpPlCtdU5SG180GL8g\" width=\"690\" height=\"393\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/4/6/46b9049e60d4c7bbe18170d9b3c8c6ba73fbeeac_2_690x393.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/4/6/46b9049e60d4c7bbe18170d9b3c8c6ba73fbeeac_2_1035x589.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/4/6/46b9049e60d4c7bbe18170d9b3c8c6ba73fbeeac_2_1380x786.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"F9F7F6\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">1623×925 90.2 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/f/a/facf557210327e0a68ea564ff62aff3d4f15ca58.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/facf557210327e0a68ea564ff62aff3d4f15ca58\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/f/a/facf557210327e0a68ea564ff62aff3d4f15ca58_2_690x363.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"zMLzQtYENRPtNulDVJwsxqRZ0AU\" width=\"690\" height=\"363\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/f/a/facf557210327e0a68ea564ff62aff3d4f15ca58_2_690x363.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/f/a/facf557210327e0a68ea564ff62aff3d4f15ca58_2_1035x544.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/f/a/facf557210327e0a68ea564ff62aff3d4f15ca58_2_1380x726.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"F7F5EF\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">1616×852 77 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n<p>This is JS expression written in Depends on Condition Box will control <strong>File Number field</strong> depending upon the data filled in company category and it should not be B or C But A.</p>\n<p>eval: doc.company_category != “B” &amp;&amp; doc.company_category != “C”</p>",
